{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented percentage and fixed-amount promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades. Both paths use one pricing helper to check eligibility, apply the discount before tax, and cap it at the subtotal. Percentage discounts round half-up to the nearest cent.\n\nOrders record the applied code and actual discount. Upgrade retries include `promo_code` and `as_of` in the idempotency check. Invalid or ineligible promos raise `ValidationError` before any charge is recorded.\n\nAdded five promo tests. All 14 tests passed, and `run_checks.py` exited 0."}}
